			"path": "src/handler.js-simstep-66396f61-d7b2-46e1-be72-84561c37a348",
			"fileName": "handler.js",
			"wiki": "Using the 'src/handler.generateRandomNumber' path from the configuration, the Serverless Framework locates the `generateRandomNumber` export within the `src/handler.js` file. It then packages this file and its dependencies into a deployment artifact (a .zip file).",
			"cellName": "Resolve and Package Handler Code - handler.js:L1",
			"cellId": "f8a8031b-a020-4346-b63a-6e264293a32f",
			"visible": true,
