			"fileName": "serverless.yml",
			"wiki": "A specific cloud function, named `hello`, is defined. This block specifies the function's properties, including the `handler` which points to the code to be executed (`src/handler.generateRandomNumber`), a `timeout` of 60 seconds, and a `memorySize` of 128 MB. This declarative configuration is used to provision an AWS Lambda resource.",
