						]
					},
					"inputDataExample": "{\n  \"handlerPath\": \"src/handler.generateRandomNumber\"\n}",
					"outputDataExample": "{\n  \"status\": \"Code located and ready for packaging and deployment.\"\n}"
				}
			],
			"description": "<ul><li>The <code>serverless</li><li>yml</code> file serves as the single source of truth for the application's cloud infrastructure</li><li>It declaratively defines the service name, cloud provider (AWS), runtime (Node</li><li>js), region, and specific function configurations like memory and timeout</li><li>This IaC approach allows for version-controlled, repeatable, and transparent infrastructure management</li></ul>",
